{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39722","headline":"题陈山人居 · 黄滔","name":"题陈山人居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犹自莓苔马迹重，石嵌泉冷嬾移峰。\n空垂凤食檐前竹，漫拔龙形涧底松。\n隔岸青山秋见寺，半牀明月夜闻钟。\n谁能惆怅磻溪事，今古悠悠不再逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}